// Trait obligation solver, coherence/overlap checking, method dispatch resolution,
// associated type lookup, and trait bound verification.
// Port of bootstrap/axiom0/src/traits/solver.{h,c} and trait/method logic in
// bootstrap/axiom0/src/types/typeck.c and bootstrap/axiom0/src/driver/mono.c.
